Hi all list members.
Just writting to tell you that I'm developing a project called FreeDCS.
It's using Xenomai as the base to build a Distributed Control System to run=
 realtime control programs in controllers and communicate with operator and=
 engineering stations. Basically I'm fucusing on the Engineering Station an=
d the controller software because it seems that's the most dificult part to=
 get running. I'm developing it in my spare time so it has been evolving qu=
ite slow=2C but this year I've had a bit more spare time to code and it's r=
eally starting to take shape.
For those interested the project=2C it's being hosted in http://sourceforge=
.net/projects/freedcs/ and http://freedcs.sourceforge.net/ In the site ther=
e are also some screenshoots but if someone wants some more of them as well=
 as more information I could upload it.
Well=2C I hope you find it interesting and spread the word.
For the Xenomai developers=2C keep the good work !!
BR=2C Robert.
